1
00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:05,930
The Sparrow

2
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:12,930
I walk along garden path.

3
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:19,280
Dog runs ahead of me.

4
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:27,860
Suddenly it stops, starts crawling.

5
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:33,970
I see along path a young sparrow.

6
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:40,950
It fell from its nest.

7
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:50,370
Dog slowly approaches, intends to bite young sparrow.

8
00:00:50,370 --> 00:01:06,220
Suddenly from high tree nearby, a mother sparrow with black wings swoops down to save child, covers child with its body.

9
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:15,080
My dog stops and retreats...

10
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:23,280
It seems it understands there is a power before it.

11
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:41,330
I call confused dog to stay away, full of admiration.

